  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "程式基礎與應用",
    "sub_ename": "PROGRAMMING FUNDAMENTALS AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在將程式設計與物流管理結合，讓學生掌握如何使用程式解決運輸與物流領域中的實際問題。課程包括理論課程和實習課程，讓學生學習基礎的程式設計知識和應用技能，並進一步練習將這些技能應用於物流管理中的各個領域。學生將通過項目設計和實踐，學習設計運輸路徑、優化庫存、貨物跟蹤和物流管理系統等方面的技能。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to integrate programming with logistics management and to equip students with the skills to use programming to solve practical problems in the field of transportation and logistics. The course consists of theory and practical sessions where students learn basic programming knowledge and application skills, and further practice applying these skills to various areas of logistics management. Students will learn skills in designing transportation routes, optimizing inventory, tracking goods, and logistics management systems through project design and practice.",
